# Student-SpendTrack-System
## Overview Project
Many students run out of balance before the end of the week because they don’t track where their money goes. The problem is they don’t have simple way to track big or small expenses. Our proposed system solution is the Student SpendTrack where students can quickly log what they buy and see how many money they have left.

##Data Structure and Algorithm used.
Data structure: [Array, Linked List, and Hash Table]
Algorithms: [Search and sort]

##Features
Data Structure:
Array - Set up weekly budget
Linked List - Add an expenses, view all expenses
Hash Table - Set up weekly budget, check remaining budget
Algorithm:
Search - Search for an expenses
Sort/Bubble sort - View biggest expenses first

## Instructions
First choose the 1 to set a budget.
Then choose 2 to add an expenses.
Choose 3 to view your all expenses, any expenses that exceeeded a budget will have its amount displayed.
Choose 4 to see expenses sorted from highest to lowest amount.
Choose 5 to check the remaining budget.
Choose 6 to search by keyword by category.
the last one is 7 to exit.
